Narrative: Modular / Sovereign Rollup — Status: Secondary Narrative (Future) — Evidence: Announced Sovereign Data Rollup architecture (not SVM rollup), custom execution, ZK/TEE verification, settling to Solana — Sources: (HIGH) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/sovereign-data-rollup/]; [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/architecture/rollup]; [Messari, https://messari.io/project/grass/profile]
Narrative: Token Incentivized Physical Infrastructure — Status: Main Narrative — Evidence: Points-to-token conversion (Epochs), node operators rewarded for bandwidth contribution — Sources: (HIGH) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/epoch-1-launch/]; [Grass Dashboard, https://app.getgrass.io/]; [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/grass-token-launch/]

